{
  "schema_version": "report-evidence/1",
  "source_sha256": "797794ee56f4ec2f4b25a2dcd86991fcdc66b9f1aaebc7a5a647d5eac8a0a6f1",
  "fragments": [
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0001",
      "text": "Buy/sell launch tokens leads ==> rewards are paid to `Launchpad` (msg.sender) instead of the user",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 97,
      "line": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0002",
      "text": "## Finding description and impact",
      "start": 99,
      "end": 132,
      "line": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0003",
      "text": "- `Distributor._distributeAssets` sends realized rewards to `msg.sender`. In stake/unstake flows, `msg.sender` is `Launchpad`, not the user.",
      "start": 133,
      "end": 273,
      "line": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0004",
      "text": "- `Launchpad` has no ERC20 forwarding or rescue; rewards accumulate on `Launchpad` and users don’t receive them. Accounting reduces `totalPendingRewards`, so value is effectively locked.",
      "start": 274,
      "end": 460,
      "line": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0005",
      "text": "- Users can trigger this by causing any update (stake/unstake vis buy/sell) to realize pending; the PoC confirms both paths.",
      "start": 461,
      "end": 585,
      "line": 6
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0006",
      "text": "- Setup (stake exists)",
      "start": 587,
      "end": 609,
      "line": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0007",
      "text": "During buy,",
      "start": 610,
      "end": 621,
      "line": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0008",
      "text": "- `LaunchToken.transfer(userA, S)` → `LaunchToken._increaseFeeShares` → `Launchpad.increaseStake(userA, S)` → `Distributor.increaseStake(baseToken, userA, S)`",
      "start": 625,
      "end": 783,
      "line": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0009",
      "text": "- State: `totalShares = S`, `userA.shares = S`",
      "start": 786,
      "end": 832,
      "line": 11
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0010",
      "text": "- Add rewards",
      "start": 834,
      "end": 847,
      "line": 13
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0011",
      "text": "- `Distributor.addRewards(baseToken, quoteToken, 0, R)`",
      "start": 850,
      "end": 905,
      "line": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0012",
      "text": "- State: `pendingQuoteRewards += R`, `totalPendingRewards[quoteToken] += R`",
      "start": 908,
      "end": 983,
      "line": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0013",
      "text": "- Trigger via stake (pays Launchpad)",
      "start": 985,
      "end": 1021,
      "line": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0014",
      "text": "- `LaunchToken.transfer(userA, δ)` → `Launchpad.increaseStake(userA, δ)` → `Distributor.increaseStake(baseToken, userA, δ)`",
      "start": 1024,
      "end": 1147,
      "line": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0015",
      "text": "- Payout: `Distributor._distributeAssets` → `quoteToken.safeTransfer(msg.sender, R)` where `msg.sender == Launchpad`",
      "start": 1150,
      "end": 1266,
      "line": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0016",
      "text": "- Accounting: `totalPendingRewards[quoteToken] -= R`",
      "start": 1269,
      "end": 1321,
      "line": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0017",
      "text": "- Trigger via unstake (also pays Launchpad)",
      "start": 1323,
      "end": 1366,
      "line": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0018",
      "text": "- `LaunchToken.transfer(launchpad, δ)` → `Launchpad.decreaseStake(userA, δ)` → `Distributor.decreaseStake(baseToken, userA, δ)`",
      "start": 1369,
      "end": 1496,
      "line": 23
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0019",
      "text": "- payout again to `Launchpad` via `safeTransfer(msg.sender, R)`",
      "start": 1499,
      "end": 1562,
      "line": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0020",
      "text": "- Result",
      "start": 1564,
      "end": 1572,
      "line": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0021",
      "text": "- User gets 0; `Launchpad` balance of `quoteToken` increases by `R`",
      "start": 1575,
      "end": 1642,
      "line": 27
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0022",
      "text": "- No ERC20 forward/rescue on `Launchpad` → rewards stuck on `Launchpad`",
      "start": 1645,
      "end": 1716,
      "line": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0023",
      "text": "### Affected code (root cause)",
      "start": 1720,
      "end": 1750,
      "line": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0024",
      "text": "https://github.com/code-423n4/2025-08-gte-perps/blob/f43e1eedb65e7e0327cfaf4d7608a37d85d2fae7/contracts/launchpad/Distributor.sol#L170-L175",
      "start": 1752,
      "end": 1891,
      "line": 34
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0025",
      "text": "https://github.com/code-423n4/2025-08-gte-perps/blob/f43e1eedb65e7e0327cfaf4d7608a37d85d2fae7/contracts/launchpad/Launchpad.sol#L423",
      "start": 1894,
      "end": 2026,
      "line": 37
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0026",
      "text": "https://github.com/code-423n4/2025-08-gte-perps/blob/f43e1eedb65e7e0327cfaf4d7608a37d85d2fae7/contracts/launchpad/LaunchToken.sol#L131",
      "start": 2029,
      "end": 2163,
      "line": 40
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0027",
      "text": "## Recommended mitigation steps",
      "start": 2168,
      "end": 2199,
      "line": 45
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0028",
      "text": "- In `Distributor`, change distribution recipient to the actual `account` on stake/unstake:",
      "start": 2201,
      "end": 2292,
      "line": 47
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0029",
      "text": "- Pass `account` to `increaseStake`/`decreaseStake` internals and use it in `_distributeAssets` instead of `msg.sender`.",
      "start": 2295,
      "end": 2415,
      "line": 48
    },
    {
      "id": "e_797794ee56f4_0030",
      "text": "- Or, have `Launchpad` capture returned amounts and immediately forward ERC20s to `account`",
      "start": 2416,
      "end": 2507,
      "line": 49
    }
  ]
}
